usage: orchestrator_agent.py [-h] [--port PORT] [--host HOST] [--name NAME]
                             --downstream DOWNSTREAM [--public-url PUBLIC_URL]

Testbed orchestrator A2A agent

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --port PORT
  --host HOST
  --name NAME
  --downstream DOWNSTREAM
                        Comma-separated downstream A2A base URLs
  --public-url PUBLIC_URL
                        Externally-reachable base URL to advertise in the
                        Agent Card (e.g. a cloudflared/ngrok tunnel). Defaults
                        to http://host:port/.
